{"layout":"logicalStructure","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有权</p><p>rust是如何管理程序资源（内存地址）</p>","expand":true,"uid":"0f36398a-a477-4246-be37-85ab2087d971","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{"smm_img_key_47658766-4845-4e46-b11c-cf078d33edff":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_23e3c4cc-8b7f-43d0-bcae-bf8145b5d185":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_6b032abb-3e73-4736-a542-4e45dfc4a23a":"data:image/png;base64,"},"freeNodeTrees":[]},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>rust语言设计</p>","uid":"13512f97-3bf8-4d95-894d-6ff4f324a9e7","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>rust语言值有俩大类</p>","uid":"4ca3f573-5bd4-48c6-bdeb-1dce95b3bacf","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>固定内存长度</p>","uid":"d6f67554-4933-4005-a7a8-86bf524069d6","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>i32 u32</p>","uid":"f74588fa-c7d8-4ff3-9226-1d8b27e42ed0","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>非固定内存长度</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"ebcc576a-e3f5-480d-9ef1-52983961220b"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>String</p>","uid":"8f6a0058-79fe-4b22-b70e-b8e3f4b3a3ea","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>在对数字类型来说，rust对标c++,会需要对应的字节数</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"b37351f5-dcdd-4566-ad79-81dfcfccd9b8"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>js数字类型只要number</p>","uid":"8f7eff9d-b834-4eb8-9deb-04b3663d234f","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>rust非固定类型靠指针或引用来指向，指针引用是固定尺寸的类型</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"50b03643-78e9-42e4-8fcc-9ace70a51772"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>和静态类型语言有关？</p>","uid":"e1745d85-5d17-4dd6-9211-cef943c315e3","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>栈和堆</p>","uid":"0efa3ef8-9731-40a8-b73a-1a98d4ccda7e","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>栈一般存放固定尺寸的值（数字类型）</p><p>栈容量限定大小不能放太大的值</p><p><br></p><p>其他非固定尺寸和值大的放在堆上面</p>","uid":"bb4c822f-366e-4798-9f77-77e52bf3ffd3","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>在程序设计中，栈空间和函数关联起来，函数调用会对应一个帧，frame栈帧,main,fn1,fn2.一个函数调用，分配新帧，调用结束，帧释放，栈帧是运行中的。函数中一些固定大小的事物，参数和局部变量放在帧上。帧释放一起回收掉。</p>","uid":"37e0b9d1-c9a8-405a-b15f-7c049dc976ab","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p><br></p>","uid":"06407ade-4617-4355-ba66-713491c2f2df","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_47658766-4845-4e46-b11c-cf078d33edff","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":461.5892547660312,"height":293,"custom":true},"imgPlacement":"bottom"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>函数的调用会形成层级关系，因此栈空间中的帧可能会同时存在很多个。</p><p>图中右边堆空间里面的一些小圈表示堆空间中资源，也就是被分配的内存。从图中可以看到，栈空间中函数帧的局部变量是可以引用这些堆上资源的。一个栈帧中的多个局部变量可以指向堆中的多个资源</p><p>如果一个资源没有被任何一个栈帧中的变量引用或间接引用，如图中的 C，那么它实际是一个被泄漏的资源，也就是发生了内存泄漏。被泄漏的资源会一直伴随程序的运行，直到程序自身的进程被停止时，才会一起被 OS 回收掉</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"15bbfa03-bd5c-48c7-a298-31df6ac30644"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>计算机内存管理安全性在堆管理</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"1f2eacd0-9c25-4a0e-8ced-7ecb663b1713"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>rust语言可变性</p>","uid":"8765d2ab-2193-498f-9d84-d977ccc30720","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>内存安全</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"4705fed2-d128-4740-84cc-b954010c74cd"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Rust 虽然也是把字符串的引用由 s1 拷贝到了 s2，但是只保留了最新的 s2 到字符串的指向，同时却把 s1 到字符串的指向给“抹去”了</p>","uid":"77246cd2-c802-4d96-99e8-5194ffc7b857","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_23e3c4cc-8b7f-43d0-bcae-bf8145b5d185","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":325.5497925311204,"height":165,"custom":true}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>基础定义</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"513b9e80-4c08-4d0b-98f3-3ff03d8658a5"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Rust 中，每一个值都有一个所有者。</p><p>一个值只有一个所有者</p><p>所有者所在作用域结束的时候，其管理的值会一起释放</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有者（code里面指的是变量）</p>","uid":"42051f19-e8db-4faa-8681-4611fc722611","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>一个所有权型变量的作用域，简单来说就是它定义时所在的那个最里层的花括号括起的部分，从变量创建时开始，到花括号结束的地方</p>","uid":"fb73b6b7-943a-4336-9112-d9f202236470","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>所有权</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"e51a7e9a-6ec7-42c8-a0ff-4465c7833332"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>内存空间</p>","uid":"9897044b-ed94-436c-bb27-6364578b46bd","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>栈空间</p>","uid":"16dc73a3-f14c-4e5b-9348-02ae4e5fd270","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>堆空间</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"23bb92c3-abdd-4c41-bb39-549dc1b494cb"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>资源与变量</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"578f1504-b241-4a3d-b5ce-dadb9d20b2f2"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>资源</p>","uid":"3e36476a-9b98-4240-8db2-bb89415d5cf4","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>变量和变量名</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"a8a3994a-f421-4741-bdbc-3388615b7f27"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>变量的类型</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"39c2e49c-ef7a-473d-b7c0-0a2c28913be7"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>变量的可变性</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"d35361fd-ed86-4fd6-9fc4-2131a6239b0e"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>变量的作用域</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"38525a49-4bfe-418e-aa7a-03a0cbe20a12"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>所有权</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"806b2c01-3f4e-4f60-b14e-b4fb2f0d0d83"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>所有权的引入</p>","uid":"c392841d-91bd-46df-9c93-841096e0f3bf","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>所有权体现的特性</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"aa6f10bc-59e5-4cb6-ae12-bbe39cccc49c"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>所有权下函数的写法</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"bbe4b085-db0a-4a47-8f8a-df29a43ebfa2"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>所有权下资源管理</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"623d33f0-4d37-462f-ae51-5a56f56dfb15"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>移动</p>","uid":"d8c2cda5-dadb-42f8-8550-d774149d7399","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>拷贝副本</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"09e59a18-1a54-4ecc-8707-75ee42f3b490"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>借用和引用</p>","uid":"b083c326-63e9-438a-88f7-47458fb3c034","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>需求点：获取一个值需要转移其所有权，那么程序会变得很复杂，是否可以使用某个变量参数指针或者引用呢？使用完毕，还所有权。</p>","uid":"6a831997-2bcb-4f37-a32d-32eb423ed227","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>借用引用一体俩面</p><p>你把东西借给别人用，别人持有对你东西的引用</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"f4179eb0-0e33-47e1-8b5a-e8e6ce05f754"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>在 rust 里面变量前使用“&amp;”，表示引用</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&amp;a;</p>","uid":"3aca86b1-8b5c-4168-8c3c-3b0354d57782","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>引用是一个固定尺寸的值，可以复制这个引用</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;b = &amp;a;&nbsp;&nbsp;*b 解引用</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"94ef0ebe-1dd5-4c22-afa2-756283a1d2c7"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>b 是对 a这个所有权变量的引用</p>","uid":"3b31b4c4-6a55-49b1-97a2-a8dc38cee140","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>可以将变量划分为</p><p>所有权型变量&nbsp;&nbsp;a</p><p>引用型变量.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;b</p>","uid":"3bdd96a0-5be1-4f5d-8bc4-bbed29aee217","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>分为可变型引用和不可变型引用</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"49ada822-2bbe-4916-83d7-6200532ee743"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>&amp;a;</p><p>&amp;mut a;&nbsp;&nbsp;//可变</p>","uid":"f1f38e6f-c78e-47ed-9ab1-f1cfc1710cb3","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>为什么需要可变型？</p>","uid":"b531c005-a11a-45ab-8a23-ea440936486e","expand":false,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>比如</p><p>你引用一个别人的库，它没有把所有权类型暴露出来，但是确实又有更新其内部状态的需求。因此需要一个东西，它既是一种引用，又能够修改指向资源的内容。于是就引入了可变引用。</p>","uid":"6d791e5b-6012-4a22-9928-6ac67ed7971f","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>可变引用和不可变引用作用域</p><p>可变和不可变不能交替</p>","uid":"be0851a1-173b-418d-958f-1529a7110928","expand":false,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>解决方法：引用改进函数</p>","uid":"56ed7557-d797-4ddc-b50a-8360998f7eae","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>在同一时刻，同一个所有权变量的不可变引用和可变引用两者不能同时存在，不可变引用可以同时存在多个。可变引用具有排它性，只能同时存在一个</p>","uid":"5f8b73fd-b46f-4dbc-a482-19bf6e00044f","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>借用结束后，原本的所有权变量会重新恢复可读可写的状态。不可变引用可以被任意复制多份，但是可变引用不能被复制，只能转移，这也体现了可变引用具有一定的所有权特征</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"4a2c6d8f-79a9-4d4b-b391-def2a2a94870"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p><br></p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"488ca7ef-ab8a-4d0d-9bde-19b8d724fc10","image":"smm_img_key_6b032abb-3e73-4736-a542-4e45dfc4a23a","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":470.1951219512195,"height":306,"custom":true}},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},"theme":{"template":"classic4","config":{}},"view":{"transform":{"scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"shear":0,"rotate":0,"translateX":-1900,"translateY":-1220,"originX":0,"originY":0,"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"e":-1900,"f":-1220},"state":{"scale":1,"x":-1910,"y":-1225.5,"sx":-1910,"sy":-1225.5}}}